<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - RoTech Medical lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - RoTech Medical lowered.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities analyst Charles Boorady confirmed on Tuesday he lowered his rating on RoTech Medical Corp to hold from buy, after the announcement of its merger with Integrated Health Services Inc.</p>
<p>-- Integrated Health and RoTech said on Monday they agreed to merge in a deal valued at about $915 million, including debt.  Under terms of the merger, Integrated Health would issue 0.5806 share for each RoTech share.</p>
<p>-- RoTech was trading up 3/16 at 20-3/16.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
